  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Cassine Gardens #270 – The Getaway, an upscale two-bedroom, one-and-a-half-bath luxury townhome located in Santa Rosa Beach, Florida. This inviting coastal retreat offers a comfortable layout and a prime location just 0.4 miles from public beach access, making it an ideal choice for a relaxed getaway near the Gulf.<br><br>The fully equipped kitchen comes complete with everything you need to whip up a quick beach snack or prepare a full gourmet dinner. The first floor features the kitchen, living area, and dining space, along with a convenient half bath. Step outside to the covered, furnished patio, where you can fire up the gas grill and enjoy easy outdoor dining. Upstairs on the second floor, you’ll find two bedrooms and a full bathroom, with each bedroom offering access to its own furnished balcony for a peaceful start or end to your day.<br><br>The bedding layout is thoughtfully arranged to provide comfort and privacy for all guests. With two separate bedrooms located on the second floor, everyone has their own relaxing space to unwind after a day at the beach or pool. The primary bedroom offers a King bed and the second bedroom offers a Twin/Full bunk and a twin trundle.<br><br>Guests of the Cassine Gardens community enjoy access to a variety of amenities, including tennis courts, a sparkling community pool, a scenic nature trail, a community grill and picnic area, and a catch-and-release lake for fishing. With public beach access just 0.4 miles away, you’re never far from the sand and surf.<br><br>Located in the heart of Santa Rosa Beach, this townhome places you close to sugar-white sands, emerald waters, and the laid-back charm of the 30A area. Explore nearby dining, shopping, and outdoor activities, or simply soak in the natural beauty that makes this stretch of Florida’s Gulf Coast so special.<br><br>Whether you’re planning a beach-focused escape or a peaceful coastal retreat, Cassine Gardens #270 – The Getaway offers the perfect home base for your next vacation. Book your stay today and start making unforgettable memories by the sea.<br><br>Clean Coverlet Program: This property provides fresh and clean bed linens, including comforters and coverlets, laundered prior to every check-in.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
